OL,3,GNEWSAPoppies made of scallop shells
OL,4,Ahonour 9/11 victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA special tribute has been made to
OL,7,Fremember the victims of the 9/11
OL,8,Fattacks - including a Cornishman whose
OL,9,Factions are credited with helping save
OL,10,Flives.
OL,12,FThe Veterans Charity invited people to
OL,13,FHayle, Cornwall, to be part of a "poppy
OL,14,Fproduction line" using about 6,000
OL,15,Fscallop shells to create 2,977 poppies
OL,16,F- one for each of the victims of the
OL,17,Fattacks that happened 25 years ago on
OL,18,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
