OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAPoppies made of scallop shells
OL,4,Ahonour 9/11 victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong the victims was Rick Rescorla,
OL,7,Foriginally from Hayle, who was a
OL,8,Fsecurity worker who managed to get
OL,9,Fpeople to safety after planes crashed
OL,10,Finto the World Trade Center.
OL,12,FIain Henderson, trustee of The Veterans
OL,13,FCharity, said the project was a
OL,14,F"fitting tribute" to Rescorla and
OL,15,Feveryone else who died.
